# Replaces the repo's own .dockerignore, which is `**` (ignore everything except
# the Gradle build's scm-server tarball) and would filter our COPY sources out of
# the build context. We do not build from source, so the context only needs the
# two config files our Dockerfile COPYs; everything else (the whole checkout) is
# excluded to keep the context tiny.
**
!panelalpha-config.yml
!panelalpha-entrypoint.sh
